```ts
import { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';
import { defineConfig } from 'vitest/config';

export default defineConfig({
    resolve: {
        alias: {
            '@': fileURLToPath(new URL('.', import.meta.url))
        }
    },
    test: {
        environment: 'node',
        include: ['tests/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}', 'content/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}']
    }
});
```

`@/` 与项目路径约定一致；`include` 限定测试发现范围，排除 Storybook 和后续 Playwright 的 `*.spec.ts`。[Vitest 配置说明](https://vitest.dev/config/include.html)

最初使用 `.ts` 出现 ESM/CommonJS 配置警告，改为 `.mts` 后警告消失，没有修改整个项目的模块类型。

**[tests/home.test.ts](/Users/chengzheng/Desktop/Files/tigerless/apsu-home-page-init/tests/home.test.ts)** 新增首页渲染冒烟测试：

```ts
import { renderToStaticMarkup } from 'react-dom/server';
import { expect, it } from 'vitest';
import Home from '@/app/page';

it('renders the home page with one main landmark', async () => {
    const markup = renderToStaticMarkup(await Home());

    expect(markup.match(/<main(?:\s[^>]*)?>/g)).toHaveLength(1);
});
```

它验证首页导入、路径别名、TSX 转换与 HTML 输出能跑通，无需启动浏览器或增加依赖。

**[README.md](/Users/chengzheng/Desktop/Files/tigerless/apsu-home-page-init/README.md)** 更新测试说明：

```markdown
`npm test` runs Node-based tests once using `vitest.config.mts`. It discovers `*.test.ts` and `*.test.tsx` under `tests/` and `content/`; Storybook and Playwright `*.spec.ts` files are outside this scope. The first smoke test renders the home page and checks that it has one main landmark.
```

